+
+## Current State Summary
+
+**Network**: Fios → Firewalla Purple (FW/DHCP/Ad-block) → 2.5GB wired + ASUS XD5 WiFi 6
+
+**Devices**:
+- Pi 5 (sirius): getArcane, Traefik, Filebrowser
+- Pi 4 4GB (altair): historylabs.dev site
