+**Key Assets Working**: 
+- GitHub for profile site
+- Traefik hot-reloading
+- Arcane API + update management
+- Jellyfin media server
+- Network ad-blocking (Firewalla)
+
+**Gaps to Address**:
+- No infrastructure-as-code in Git
